{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Beyond the Curtains&quot; is a cozy game about watching the world through a window.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No tutorials. No quests. No goals to chase.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Poke at anything on screen\u2014the hourglass, passersby, objects in the room\u2014and see what happens. Or do nothing at all, just watching people go by.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2648940/extras/6ed4cda4ac95f918c1e4176cf83d2fe9.poster.avif?t=1772819275\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2648940/extras/6ed4cda4ac95f918c1e4176cf83d2fe9.webm?t=1772819275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2648940/extras/6ed4cda4ac95f918c1e4176cf83d2fe9.mp4?t=1772819275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Like an aimless stroll with no destination in mind.\u00a0Until one day, you notice something has quietly changed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2648940/extras/6e1ac62bec6dcb35d83896a53a929622.poster.avif?t=1772819275\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2648940/extras/6e1ac62bec6dcb35d83896a53a929622.webm?t=1772819275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2648940/extras/6e1ac62bec6dcb35d83896a53a929622.mp4?t=1772819275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Even so, the ordinary world keeps turning.&quot;\u00a0Sometimes, just realizing this is enough to bring peace.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >At Your Own Pace</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time only moves forward when you press the &quot;nap&quot; button. No rush, no FOMO\u2014we don't want you to feel hurried.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2648940/extras/ae8043851ec1f706ac1229558654f03f.avif?t=1772819275\" width=1283 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Linger in a single moment as long as you like, or skip ahead to whenever you please. The view outside changes with time, and so does the room itself.\u00a0Perhaps you'll piece together fragments of the room owner's story...?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Three Themes to Explore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a long development journey, we've prepared three themes for you</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2648940/extras/4cb5245ed90550d6d70c052294568087.avif?t=1772819275\" width=838 height=470 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Last Leaf</strong>: Heartwarming daily life in a small town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scenic Tour</strong>: Travel by train through beautiful landscapes, accompanied by local delicacies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gravekeeper</strong>: A resting place for souls, where emotions linger at life's end.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Little Touches</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's a music player in the room\u2014tune into whichever station you prefer.\u00a0The interface hides in subtle places, keeping buttons minimal and immersion high.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here's a window that's always sunny, just for you :)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2648940/extras/42d62efc4aa86c8b87355be4ab88cdb0.poster.avif?t=1772819275\" width=550 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2648940/extras/42d62efc4aa86c8b87355be4ab88cdb0.webm?t=1772819275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2648940/extras/42d62efc4aa86c8b87355be4ab88cdb0.mp4?t=1772819275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2648940?t=1772819275","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2648940?t=1772819275","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2648940/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772819275","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2648940/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772819275","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3001720,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Beyond the Curtains&quot; is a cozy game about watching the world through a window.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No tutorials. No quests. No goals to chase.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Poke at anything on screen\u2014the hourglass, passersby, objects in the room\u2014and see what happens. Or do nothing at all, just watching people go by.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2648940/extras/6ed4cda4ac95f918c1e4176cf83d2fe9.poster.avif?t=1772819275\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2648940/extras/6ed4cda4ac95f918c1e4176cf83d2fe9.webm?t=1772819275\" type=\